  "title": "MARTEN TRANSPORT APPOINTS ADAM PHILLIPS AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER",
  "summary": "MONDOVI, Wis., December 13, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Marten Transport, Ltd. (Nasdaq/GS:MRTN) announced that its Board of Directors has appointed Adam D. Phillips to an executive officer as its Executive Vice President and Chief Operating Officer, effective December 13, 2023. “I’m extremely pleased to announce the appointment of Adam Phillips as our Executive Vice President…",
